          "content": {
            "size": 3918,
            "mimeType": "text/html; charset=utf-8",
            "compression": 2324,
            "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n    <head>\n        <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n\n        <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" sizes=\"180x180\" href=\"/apple-touch-icon.png\">\n        <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"32x32\" href=\"/favicon-32x32.png\">\n        <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/png\" sizes=\"16x16\" href=\"/favicon-16x16.png\">\n        <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/site.webmanifest\">\n        <meta name=\"msapplication-TileColor\" content=\"#ffffff\">\n        <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#ffffff\">\n\n        <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\" />\n\n        <title>Karina Sirqueira</title>\n        <meta name=\"description\" content=\"I&#x27;m Karina Sirqueira, a Brazilian designer at Work&amp;Co in Brooklyn.\" />\n\n        <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Karina Sirqueira\" />\n        <meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://images.prismic.io/karina-sirqueira/58ff0832-15aa-41d6-b5e7-f0901a3fb253_Open+Graph.png?auto&#x3D;compress,format\" />\n        <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"I&#x27;m Karina Sirqueira, a Brazilian designer at Work&amp;Co in Brooklyn.\" />\n\n        <meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\" />\n        <meta name=\"twitter:title\" content=\"Karina Sirqueira\" />\n        <meta name=\"twitter:description\" content=\"I&#x27;m Karina Sirqueira, a Brazilian designer at Work&amp;Co in Brooklyn.\" />\n        <meta name=\"twitter:image:src\" content=\"https://images.prismic.io/karina-sirqueira/58ff0832-15aa-41d6-b5e7-f0901a3fb253_Open+Graph.png?auto&#x3D;compress,format\" />\n      <script type=\"module\" crossorigin src=\"/assets/main.c1f6367f.js\"></script>\n      <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/main.d00e416c.css\">\n    <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/manifest.webmanifest\"></head>\n    <body>\n        <div class=\"app\" data-template=\"about\">\n                <section class=\"about\">\n                    <div class=\"about__wrapper\">\n                        <p class=\"about__title\">\n                            <span class=\"about__title__text\">\n                                About\n                            </span>\n                        </p>\n            \n                        <a class=\"about__close\" href=\"/\">\n                            <span class=\"about__close__icon\"></span> Close\n                        </a>\n            \n                        <div class=\"about__content\">\n                            <h1>I’m Karina Sirqueira, a Brazilian designer at Airbnb, NY.</h1><p>I was lucky to start my career at globo.com, where I got passionate about designing digital products. After 5 years I moved to the agency world. First Huge in Rio. Then Elephant in SF. Now Work &amp; Co, where I’ve worked with great clients like Apple, MTA, Aldo, and Clover. I’ve also been developing new skills and challenging myself to come up with a new idea every day that combines design and code.</p><p>As a female designer, I’ve needed to overcome some barriers in my career. It’s taught me to push through and stand up for myself. I want to inspire other designers to do the same, so don’t hesitate to reach out. I’m always online.</p><p>Find me on <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/karinasirqueira/\" target=\"undefined\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://twitter.com/KarinaSirqueira\" target=\"undefined\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Twitter</a>, <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/karinasirqueira/\" target=\"undefined\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">LinkedIn</a>.</p>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </section>\n        </div>\n\n        \n\n        <script async src=\"https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=UA-85019401-1\"></script>\n        <script>\n            function gtag() {\n                dataLayer.push(arguments);\n            }\n\n            (window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || []), gtag('js', new Date()), gtag('config', 'UA-85019401-1');\n        </script>\n    </body>\n</html>\n"
